#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512376"
msgid "…I hear the nearby sound of water running."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512420"
msgid "I've felt this coaster, which descends into the\ncenter of minds, a few times before. It resembles\na boat being drawn through a whirlpool into Hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512568"
msgid "I was born from an ocean of pleasure.\nFrom an ocean of milk that would melt itself,\nmelt even those who would protect it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512692"
msgid "I was invisible. Formless, with an empty mind.\nI was an #C000246204Ego#CDEF that only melted, stole, and\nconverted into itself all that it touched."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512840"
msgid "Lifeforms, to me, are nothing more than\nnutrients. They are as #ROFS-002#RUBScapsules#RUBEpills#REND that I let tumble\nabout in the palm of my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512992"
msgid "To me, the world is a boring dish on a table,\nor a castle of sand made on the beach.\nIt all gets washed away and sent back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513124"
msgid "Ahh, but then――\nthen, I learned about love.\nI learned what it's like to be in love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513212"
msgid "The thought corrupted me completely.\nI'm no longer a shapeless #C000246204Ego#CDEF.\nI'm no longer aimless pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513328"
msgid "In order to protect you, the object of my love,\nI offer my #RUBSeverything#RUBEentire body#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513428"
msgid "Giving another your entire self―full control of\nboth mind and body. It's a fitting form of love\nfor one who assimilates and absorbs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513564"
msgid "#C000246204Meltlilith#CDEF… Your thoughts may be evil, but your\ndevotion to your love seems genuine.\nStill, it goes a step too far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513700"
msgid "I feel her stare. She wants me to look at her.\nBut it's ok. I have no feelings for #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nHer love is all wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513836"
msgid "She'll offer everything, she says?\nHow could something born out of self-indulgence\never protect anyone else's happiness?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513960"
msgid "Hmph.\nDoes she not realize such vows will deny her\nof her very self? How blind can she be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514052"
msgid "A being born from a desire to control has awoken\nto a desire to protect. Ready to become foam and\nfade. Sounds like a familiar children's tale."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514196"
msgid "I have only you. You only have me.\nI will remold this world to keep it that way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514280"
msgid "You are a bamboo boat, the one little light\nin this world left to sail across me――\nyour ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514380"
msgid "But don't worry. In my ocean, wind does not\nblow. Waves do not rise over. Mine is a calm\nocean you can cross in peace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514500"
msgid "A boundless world without end where\nI'll continue tolerating you forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514576"
msgid "And so, I beg you…\ndrown and melt into the sweet nectar.\nForget even your own name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514664"
msgid "Find rest within me, worthless and with\nyour mouth shut forevermore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514736"
msgid "As the ice melts into its water,\nas the sugar dissolves into its honey,\nwe will let nothing come between us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514848"
msgid "In my arms, you will become my love.\nWhere else in the world could you find greater\n#ROFS0003#RUBS happiness#RUBEpleasure#REND than this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514988"
msgid "I'm a tad late to be saying this, but isn't\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF the spitting image of a naive little\ngirl? More so than #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, I'd argue…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515156"
msgid "While there is no ocean like that in this world,\nto call it \"paradise\" is a stretch.\nNo, the life she promises you is Hell itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515288"
msgid "A calm sea is anything but peaceful. It's dead.\nHer idea of love is giving her tepid embrace to\nthe lifeless corpse of her choosing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515424"
msgid "Everything is to be within her? She's more of a\nlittle girl than a woman. I thought only\na goddess could love her playthings this way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515560"
msgid "…I learned about love. I learned your name.\nI want you to tell me everything about yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515656"
msgid "The mingling of breaths and bodily fluids?\nThe laying of skin on skin?\nThese are all superficial pleasures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515764"
msgid "With absorption comes true understanding.\nI'll dissolve you and mix your all into my\nperson. I'll give you all of me in return."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515892"
msgid "That is what makes#ROFS0002#RUBS    the perfect world#RUBE me Meltlilith#REND――\na supreme cradle made solely for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516012"
msgid "You'll never suffer again,\nfor everything will be made for you out of me:\nlove, wanting love, fear, hurt, everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516132"
msgid "Close your eyes and shut your mouth.\nYou are me, and I am love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516196"
msgid "The sugar that dissolves into honey,\nthe you that dissolves into my affection.\nThat love, all of it, belongs to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516312"
msgid "In complete contrast to the cruel #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nwe pass through warm thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516408"
msgid "These are her true feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516440"
msgid "A mind that deeply wishes for her lover's\nhappiness to the point of losing itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516524"
msgid "Be that as it may, it's clear that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF\nand I aren't on the same page."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516620"
msgid "Even if she hasn't the slightest intent to kill,\nshe's still an enemy we need to defeat if we're\nto move forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516736"
msgid "Figuratively speaking, we're looking at the\neleventh hour."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516796"
msgid "I steel my mind and descend,\ndown to the bottom of this ocean of pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516872"
msgid "That way, I can reject this obsessive love\nat its very core――"
msgstr ""

